        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 7412, Gravity Door Pivot Hinge Surface Mounted</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer 7412 Gravity Door Pivot Hinge, Surface Mounted. Cast Brass construction pivot hinge for doors up to 24\" wide, 1-7/8\" thick with a maximum door weight of 35 lbs. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/box-clamp-mount-gravity-door-pivot-hinge-bommer-7411\"><b>Bommer 7411</b></a> Box Clamp Mount Gravity Door Pivot Hinge.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer Industries has been in business since 1876, with over 140 years of quality products. Their products are American made with American metals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Surface Mount Gravity Door Pivot:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Width: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Thickness: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 35 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Brass Construction</li>\r\n<li>Surface Mounted Pivot</li>\r\n<li>Double Acting</li>\r\n<li>Door weight closes door. No Springs</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Flat Door Bracket: For doors not less than 3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Flat Jamb Bracket: 1-1/4\" Wide</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with #10 - 1\" Flat Head Wood Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7412.pdf?v=1691094995\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 7412 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a> </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSold individually as a set, with 1 pivot , 1 each jamb and door bracket, 1 top pivot assembly with jamb bracket, and mounting hardware. Enough to do one door.\r\n</p>",
